{"parentUuid":"bdb10217-9de4-41fe-b902-928cdfce1583","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6b8557a2-9430-4f17-946a-1ea07dab5643","agentId":"aa43418fbebf671c6","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BCGizFyKtribrWHYf7qYXP","type":"tool_result","content":"1:# Configuration Reference\n9:## Settings for Local computer access with Work Cloud\n29:### Agent Security requirements for Local computer access with Work Cloud\n33:#### Exposed in the Agent Security UI\n38:#### Configured through TOML\n54:### Local computer access with Work Cloud compatibility limits\n75:## `config.toml`\n131:      key: \"model_auto_compact_token_limit\",\n134:        \"Token threshold that triggers automatic history compaction (unset uses model defaults).\",\n137:      key: \"model_auto_compact_token_limit_scope\",\n140:        \"Controls whether the auto-compaction threshold counts the full active context (`total`, the default) or only growth after the carried compaction-window prefix (`body_after_prefix`).\",\n346:      key: \"compact_prompt\",\n348:      description: \"Inline override for the history compaction prompt.\",\n369:      key: \"experimental_compact_prompt_file\",\n372:        \"Load the compaction prompt override from a file (experimental).\",\n560:        \"Matcher groups for hook events such as `PreToolUse`, `PermissionRequest`, `PostToolUse`, `PreCompact`, `PostCompact`, `SessionStart`, `SessionEnd`, `SubagentStart`, `SubagentStop`, `UserPromptSubmit`, `Stop`, or `Interrupt`.\",\n1827:#:schema https://developers.openai.com/codex/config-schema.json\n1832:## `requirements.toml`\n2595:        \"Matcher groups for a hook event such as `PreToolUse`, `PermissionRequest`, `PostToolUse`, `PreCompact`, `PostCompact`, `SessionStart`, `SessionEnd`, `SubagentStart`, `SubagentStop`, `UserPromptSubmit`, or `Stop`.\",","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"1410a994-d01b-4715-af2c-3d3afd844a29","timestamp":"2026-10-03T14:54:14.923Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"bdb10217-9de4-41f