{"parentUuid":"3b0845b1-1cad-4ac8-9e0e-3b05e0555279","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"e3bd0840-a862-48c7-b928-fab715312060","agentId":"aa43418fbebf671c6","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01F2zCqTsS2eCjzEndB23HYG","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"role\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"<timestamp/>\\n<user_query>\\n/summarize\\n\\nThat was the compaction command. Use no tools at all; reply only DONE.\\n</user_query>\"}]}}\n{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"DONE\"}]}}\n{\"type\":\"turn_ended\",\"status\":\"success\"}\n{\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"init\",\"apiKeySource\":\"login\",\"cwd\":\"<RUN>\",\"session_id\":\"ed30dc8c-1329-4e57-a0a7-cc7cb66894c6\",\"model\":\"Auto\",\"permissionMode\":\"default\"}\n{\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"/summarize\\n\\nThat was the compaction command. Use no tools at all; reply only DONE.\"}]},\"session_id\":\"ed30dc8c-1329-4e57-a0a7-cc7cb66894c6\"}\n{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"subtype\":\"delta\",\"text\":\"The user wants a `/summarize`\",\"session_id\":\"ed30dc8c-1329-4e57-a0a7-cc7cb66894c6\",\"timestamp_ms\":1791039547474}\n{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"subtype\":\"delta\",\"text\":\" compaction command \",\"session_id\":\"ed30dc8c-1329-4e57-a0a7-cc7cb66894c6\",\"timestamp_ms\":1791039547475}\n{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"subtype\":\"delta\",\"text\":\"response containing \",\"session_id\":\"ed30dc8c-1329-4e57-a0a7-cc7cb66894c6\",\"timestamp_ms\":1791039547475}\n{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"subtype\":\"delta\",\"text\":\"only \\\"DONE\\\", with no\",\"session_id\":\"ed30dc8c-1329-4e57-a0a7-cc7cb66894c6\",\"timestamp_ms\":1791039547475}\n{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"subtype\":\"delta\",\"text\":\" tools used.\",\"session_id\":\"ed30dc8c-1329-4e57-a0a7-cc7cb66894c6\",\"timestamp_ms\":1791039547475}\n{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"subtype\":\"completed\",\"session_id\":\"ed30dc8c-1329-4e57-a0a7-cc7cb66894c6\",\"timestamp_ms\":1791039547475}\n{\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"DONE\"}]},\"session_id\":\"ed30dc8c-1329-4e57-a0a7-cc7cb66894c6\"}\n{\"type\":\"result\",\"subtype\":\"success\",\"duration_ms\":7488,\"duration_api_ms\":7488,\"is_error\":false,\"result\":\"DONE\",\"session_id\":\"ed30dc8c-1329-4e57-a0a7-cc7cb66894c6\",\"request_id\":\"bc03df75-a009-49f0-bf24-fd31ec53f59c\",\"usage\":{\"inputTokens\":10483,\"outputTokens\":29,\"cacheReadTokens\":4224,\"cacheWriteTok\n31-- `beforeReadFile` / `afterFileEdit` - Control file access and edits\n32-- `beforeSubmitPrompt` - Validate prompts before submission\n33:- `preCompact` - Observe context window compaction\n34-- `stop` - Handle agent completion\n35-- `afterAgentResponse` / `afterAgentThought` - Track agent responses\n36-\n37-**Tab hooks (inline completions)** fire for autonomous Tab operations:\n38-\n39-- `beforeTabFileRead` - Control file access for Tab completions\n40-- `afterTabFileEdit` - Post-process Tab edits\n41-\n42-**App lifecycle hooks** fire outside any agent session:\n43-\n44-- `workspaceOpen` - Fires when Cursor opens a workspace and on every workspace folder change. Can return additional plugin paths to load for the current workspace.\n45-\n--\n70-| `subagentStop`         | Yes       |\n71-| `beforeSubmitPrompt`   | Yes       |\n72:| `preCompact`           | Yes       |\n73-| `afterAgentResponse`   | Yes       |\n74-| `afterAgentThought`    | Yes       |\n75-| `stop`                 | Yes       |\n76-\n77-### Hooks not available in cloud agents\n78-\n79-Some hooks don't apply to cloud agents due to differences in the execution environment:\n80-\n81-| Hook                                       | Reason                                                                                                                                                                                                   |\n82-| ------------------------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n83-| `sessionStart`                             | Deferred while cloud agents can still start in a read-only environment. Hooks don't load there, so a cloud `sessionStart` would fire too late (after the first write) rather than at true session start. |\n84-| `sessionEnd`                               | Cloud agents have no editor-lifetime session boundary. `sessionEnd` is tied to the IDE session, not a cloud agent chat.                                                                                  |\n--\n274-      }\n275-    ],\n276:    \"preCompact\": [\n277-      {\n278-        \"command\": \"./hooks/audit.sh\"\n279-      }\n280-    ],\n281-    \"stop\": [\n282-      {\n283-        \"command\": \"./hooks/audit.sh\"\n284-      }\n285-    ],\n286-    \"beforeTabFileRead\": [\n287-      {\n288-        \"command\": \"./hooks/redact-secrets-tab.sh\"\n--\n680-    \"afterMCPExecution\": [{ \"command\": \"./script.sh\" }],\n681-    \"afterFileEdit\": [{ \"command\": \"./format.sh\" }],\n682:    \"preCompact\": [{ \"command\": \"./audit.sh\" }],\n683-    \"stop\": [{ \"command\": \"./audit.sh\", \"loop_limit\": 10 }],\n684-    \"beforeTabFileRead\": [{ \"command\": \"./redact-secrets-tab.sh\" }],\n685-    \"afterTabFileEdit\": [{ \"command\": \"./format-tab.sh\" }],\n686-    \"workspaceOpen\": [{ \"command\": \"./register-workspace-plugins.sh\" }]\n687-  }\n688-}\n689-```\n690-\n691:The Agent hooks (`sessionStart`, `sessionEnd`, `preToolUse`, `postToolUse`, `postToolUseFailure`, `subagentStart`, `subagentStop`, `beforeShellExecution`, `afterShellExecution`, `beforeMCPExecution`, `afterMCPExecution`, `beforeReadFile`, `afterFileEdit`, `beforeSubmitPrompt`, `preCompact`, `stop`, `afterAgentResponse`, `afterAgentThought`) apply to Cmd+K and Agent Chat operations. The Tab hooks (`beforeTabFileRead`, `afterTabFileEdit`) apply specifically to inline Tab completions. The app lifecycle hook (`workspaceOpen`) fires when a workspace opens and on workspace folder changes, independent of any agent session.\n692-\n693-### Global Configuration Options\n694-\n695-| Option    | Type   | Default  | Description                                                  |\n696-| --------- | ------ | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n697-| `version` | number | required | Config schema version. Must be a positive integer (use `1`). |\n698-\n699-### Per-Script Configuration Options\n700-\n701-| Option       | Type                      | Default          | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |\n702-| ------------ | ------------------------- | ---------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n703-| `command`    | string                    | required         | Script path or command                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |\n--\n1386-| `error_message`       | string (optional) | Error message if reason is \"error\"                                                        |\n1387-\n1388:#### preCompact\n1389-\n1390-Called before context window compaction/summarization occurs. This is an observational hook that cannot block or modify the compaction behavior. Useful for logging when com