{"parentUuid":"6ea86ce5-f5cc-471f-8993-55bdc64f50ad","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"aa43418fbebf671c6","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CffZFrYfGVFTCMA7RsvYx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The first sr-checks run hit its 30-minute background limit and was stopped, so I restarted it with the longest timeout. I'm waiting for it to finish.\n\nWork is committed and rebased on origin/main but not pushed, and no PR exists yet. The checks have not completed, so nothing has been verified by them.\n\n- **codex: supported, with deviations.**\n  - Recorded run: `codex-mock/snapshots/runs/compaction-transcript-continuity`, captured with `-c model_auto_compact_token_limit=4000`. The real codex compacted after each tool call.\n  - What the recording shows: it writes one `compacted` record per compaction. The records are chained by `window_id` / `previous_window_id`. The replacement history holds the kept user prompt, then an opaque encrypted summary item.\n  - Mock: `codex-mock/internal/runner/compact.go` builds that record using the core `PlanBoundary`. `-c model_auto_compact_token_limit` triggers it. The adapter is marked `sr:provides compaction-transcript-continuity/codex`.\n  - Test: `codex-mock/e2e/001_hooks/compaction_test.go`, marked `sr:proves`.\n  - Cell: cites a newly frozen doc, `config-reference#configtoml`. Two deviations:\n    - capability-grounding: Codex writes one record keyed by windows, not boundary, summary and tail linked by record parents.\n    - modeled-surface: the mock estimates tokens as four characters each, keeps only the prompt, and doesn't write the other records Codex adds or fire PreCompact/PostCompact.\n  - Existing files touched: I made small edits to `run.go` and `tool_host.go`, which carry other capabilities' markers. The judges may re-check those pairs.\n  - Test results: `go build`, `go vet` and `go test ./codex-mock/...` passed.\n- **cursor: unsupported.**\n  - Recorded run: `cursor-mock/snapshots/runs/compaction-transcript-continuity`. The `/summarize` prompt in `-p` mode was treated as plain text, `preCompact` never fired, and the transcript has only user and assistant lines.\n  - Weak spot: I did not force a real context-overflow compaction in cursor, which would have been costly. The Cursor hooks doc says `preCompact` exists, so the reason is limited to what headless `-p` shows. A reviewer may push back on that.\n  - Capture setup: cursor-agent auto-updated to 2026.10.01 while the repo's `MANIFEST.yaml` is pinned at 2026.09.28. I captured with the old 2026.09.28 binary via a PATH shim. Anyone running `capture.sh` on cursor will hit that version mismatch unless they do the same.\n\nStill to do once sr-checks is clean: push, open the PR titled \"codex: compaction-transcript-continuity ...\", watch CI, and admin-merge only if every check passes."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1005,"cache_read_input_tokens":158208,"output_tokens":986,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1005},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":986,"cache_read_input_tokens":158208,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1005,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1005,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CffZFrA6uJmaCZDuLnm8K","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"1e1cc6ca-c956-4a02-9284-ff9a4eafae3a","timestamp":"2026-10-03T15:41:07.433Z","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/