{"parentUuid":"579c7de8-9522-4808-ae98-7f908f3b7fe1","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"aa43418fbebf671c6","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CffcRb4sgGTqteaq1Kg2J","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The third sr-checks run still refused. I fixed the two refusals that were mine and started a fourth run, which is still going. Nothing is pushed, there is no PR yet, and no check has passed.\n\n**What I fixed**\n- **Two core markers.** `capability-once` found two `sr:capability compaction-transcript-continuity` markers in `internal/`. I removed the one on `Budget.Spend`, so only `PlanBoundary` carries it.\n- **Orphaned claude-mock files.** Narrowing the compaction module glob left `claude-mock/internal/runner/control.go` and `control_fork.go` in no module. I restored the original `control*.go` glob.\n\n**What I expect to remain**\n- **Pre-existing refusals.** `module-distinct` on that wide glob and `module-leaks` on `control_fork.go` were already there. They are about claude-mock code I did not write, so I'm leaving them.\n- **Misattributed refusals.** The `capability-grounded` and `capability-rigor` refusals concern other capabilities' statements and tests (SessionEnd, Stop, UserPromptSubmit, matchers, hook-output records). They name my files only because I touched `run.go`, `file.go` and `MANIFEST.yaml`. I'll report them rather than rewrite other capabilities.\n- **Open design question.** The first run raised, and this run may raise again, that no ADR decides whether the mock's compaction trigger is scripted or estimated from tokens. I can't write that ADR without the user.\n\nNext, if the run shows only those: push, open the PR, and watch CI. I'll admin-merge only if every check passes. If the leftover refusals do fail CI, I'll stop and report instead of merging."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":792,"cache_read_input_tokens":192320,"output_tokens":567,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":792},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":567,"cache_read_input_tokens":192320,"cache_creation_input_tokens":792,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":792,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CffcRamX7LphEKQhVkwhF","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"7fa9aa60-2efa-4535-9b90-bf125619901f","timestamp":"2026-10-03T16:22:37.171Z","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-aa43418fbebf671c6","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-a11c0a040e3cf682b"}
