{"parentUuid":"0e1eac61-6630-4c43-851f-21665a66aecc","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"aa43418fbebf671c6","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cffd9QZGs1fkch7WS2HgY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1550,"cache_read_input_tokens":196121,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1550,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cffd9QGupeQGRnd2oK8KW","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"d188cc8d-1b4f-4288-b02f-b78a7ab88468","timestamp":"2026-10-03T16:32:07.057Z","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-aa43418fbebf671c6","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-adc1470310079e23b"}
{"parentUuid":"d188cc8d-1b4f-4288-b02f-b78a7ab88468","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"aa43418fbebf671c6","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cffd9QZGs1fkch7WS2HgY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The push was refused, so there is no PR and nothing is merged. The `verify-before-push` gate won't let HEAD (`7f12a6d`) go out until sr-checks comes back clean, and the last run still shows refusals. I did not try to get around the gate.\n\n**What is done**\n- Everything is committed locally on `worktree-agent-aa43418fbebf671c6`, rebased on origin/main (`go build`, `go vet` and `go test ./codex-mock/...` passed before the last two small commits).\n- **codex: supported with two deviations** (capability-grounding, modeled-surface).\n  - Recorded run: `codex-mock/snapshots/runs/compaction-transcript-continuity`. It is a `compacted` record chained by `window_id`, with the kept prompt and an opaque summary.\n  - Mock: `codex-mock/internal/runner/compact.go` writes that record. The trigger is `internal/compaction/budget.go`, a token budget in core.\n  - Test: `codex-mock/e2e/001_hooks/compaction_test.go`.\n  - Frozen doc: `config-reference#configtoml`.\n- **cursor: unsupported.** Recorded in `cursor-mock/snapshots/runs/compaction-transcript-continuity`: `/summarize` under `-p` is plain text and no `preCompact` fires.\n  - Caveat: I did not force a real context-overflow compaction.\n  - The run was captured with the old 2026.09.28 binary, because `cursor-agent` auto-updated and `capture.sh` refuses a version mismatch.\n\n**What the last sr-checks run still refuses (none of it is about my cells)**\n- **Other capabilities' refusals.** Ten or so `capability-grounded` and `capability-rigor` items about SessionEnd, Stop, UserPromptSubmit, matchers, stdin and hook-output records. The judges re-run them on my branch because I touched shared files: `run.go`, `file.go`, `exec.go` and `MANIFEST.yaml`. I did not rewrite other capabilities.\n- **Compaction module glob.** `claude-mock/internal/runner/control*.go` is too wide (`module-distinct`), but narrowing it leaves `control.go` and `control_fork.go` in no module (`module-coverage`). Only a change to the other modules' homes fixes it. This was already there before my change.\n- **No ADR for the trigger.** Earlier runs also asked the user to decide, with an ADR, whether the mock's compaction trigger is scripted or estimated from tokens.\n\n**Decision for you:** how do you want to get these through the gate? Options:\n- Authorise the push despite the unrelated refusals.\n- Have me move `control.go` and `control_fork.go` into the subagents/hooks and session modules' homes.\n- Fix those other capabilities' cells and tests first.\n\nI'll continue from whichever you pick."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1550,"cache_read_input_tokens":196121,"output_tokens":1018,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":52},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1550},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1018,"cache_read_input_tokens":196121,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1550,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1550,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cffd9QGupeQGRnd2oK8KW","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"dcfad8a5-c897-4148-aea3-66b6489a6ce0","timestamp":"2026-10-03T16:32:07.776Z","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-aa43418fbebf671c6","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666"