{"parentUuid":"87e911df-cd19-4742-b28c-f341d9ea7f04","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"aa43418fbebf671c6","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cffg8utTd2o7cU2sYbraZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've applied the coordinator's instructions and started a seventh sr-checks run, which is still going. I haven't pushed anything, so there is no PR or merge yet.\n\n- **No `module.yaml` edits.** `internal/compaction/module.yaml` is back to origin/main. The codex adapter now lives in `codex-mock/internal/session/compact.go`, which the session module's home already covers. `internal/compaction/budget.go` is covered by `internal/compaction/**`.\n- **`run.go` is back to origin/main.** I no longer edit `Run`. `codex-mock/exec.go` now sets the compaction limit and prompt through `session.AutoCompact` before calling `runner.Run`, and `File.ToolOutput` starts counting toward it. The one deviation is a package-level setting in the session package, which is less clean than passing config through `Run`.\n- **Test.** `go test ./codex-mock/e2e/...` passes with the new wiring.\n\nI'll read the run's result when it finishes. If it's clean, I push, open the PR, watch CI and admin-merge once every check passes. If `noninteractive-run/codex` still refuses, that's the debt agent's pair; I'll wait for it to land, rebase and re-run."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":772,"cache_read_input_tokens":213276,"output_tokens":409,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":772},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":409,"cache_read_input_tokens":213276,"cache_creation_input_tokens":772,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":772,"ep