{"parentUuid":"e43fbbf4-4ed9-48df-ae2c-73fd1cf3833e","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"aa43418fbebf671c6","attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14779558 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"05c346e8-2b5f-4d0a-ab1d-de2d716150d8","timestamp":"2026-10-03T17:25:43.671Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14779558 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-aa43418fbebf671c6","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-ab2efb1b0554a0078"}
{"parentUuid":"05c346e8-2b5f-4d0a-ab1d-de2d716150d8","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"aa43418fbebf671c6","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CffhF5dP4ZKBJqHe3ADEG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Nothing is pushed and there is no PR. The last sr-checks run left one refusal. The ADR that should clear it is written and staged but not committed. A commit gate blocked it, and I stopped the follow-up sr-checks run because it would have judged HEAD without the ADR.\n\nThe refusal is `concern-undeclared`. It says no ADR decides that a mock estimates tokens (`compaction.CharsPerToken`, in the new core `internal/compaction/budget.go`) and compacts when that estimate passes a limit. Everything else came back clean. That includes the `noninteractive-run/codex` pair, since I no longer edit `Run`.\n\nI wrote `adr/mock-compaction-trigger/ADR.md`, as the coordinator authorised. It says:\n- A harness whose compaction the scenario can script compacts on that record, with token counts it isn't given set to 0.\n- A harness that only has its own threshold (Codex) compacts on a token budget set by the run, estimated at four characters to the token, with the budget and estimate living once in `internal/compaction`.\n- The estimate is a modelled-surface deviation of the cell.\n\nThe commit was refused by the `cite-before-commit` gate. Because the ADR is an ADR file, it needs a `Sloprail-Cites-User` quote from a message the user wrote in the main conversation. The only authorisation I have is the coordinator's message, which the gate does not count. I did not invent a quote or work around the gate.\n\n**Decision for you:** either supply the exact user words that authorise the ADR (the commit trailer is `Sloprail-Cites-User: <exact quote>`), or commit `adr/mock-compaction-trigger/ADR.md` yourself. After that I run sr-checks, push, open the PR, wait for CI and admin-merge once every check passes.\n\nCells are unchanged:\n- **codex: supported.** Recorded in `codex-mock/snapshots/runs/compaction-transcript-continuity`, with a mock adapter in `codex-mock/internal/session/compact.go` and a test. It carries two deviations (capability-grounding, modeled-surface).\n- **cursor: unsupported.** Recorded in `cursor-mock/snapshots/runs/compaction-transcript-continuity`, where `/summarize` under `-p` is plain text and no `preCompact` fires. I did not force a real context-overflow compaction.\n- **cursor capture binary.** It was captured with the 2026.09.28 binary, because cursor-agent auto-updated to 2026.10.01 and `capture.sh` refuses a version mismatch."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":466,"cache_read_input_tokens":220285,"output_tokens":860,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":466},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":860,"cache_read_input_tokens":220285,"cache_creation_input_tokens":466,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":466,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CffhF5Lm2zyTWv1erpWys","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"51bf4a76-a0fe-4c66-aa64-5cbb1e17496b","timestamp":"2026-10-03T17:25:50.465Z","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-aa43418fbebf671c6","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-ab2efb1b0554a0078"}
