{"parentUuid":"39588d27-a459-482c-ba60-2a875b90cac2","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"aa43418fbebf671c6","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cffhs2DVGMN25kyTKsFNe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I couldn't push, open a PR or merge, because one refusal needs a quote from you. The local branch `worktree-agent-aa43418fbebf671c6` is committed and rebased on origin/main, and the tree is clean.\n\n**What blocks it**\n- **ADR grounding.** The ninth sr-checks run was clean on the cells, the mock, the tests and the modules. The one remaining refusal is `adr-grounded` on `adr/mock-compaction-trigger/ADR.md`. That ADR is what cleared the earlier `concern-undeclared` refusal about the token-budget trigger. The rule wants the user's own words in the commit that adds it.\n- **Why my citation doesn't count.** The commit carries a `Sloprail-Cites-Tool` trailer quoting the earlier refusal that asked for this decision. The coordinator's authorisation is not a user message.\n- **Well-formedness.** I tightened the ADR wording after the `adr-well-formed` refusal: it now names `claude-mock/internal/runner/control_compact.go` and the `deviations` field of the cell. That change is amended into the same commit and was not re-run.\n\n**What I need from you**\n- Ask the user to approve the decision in the ADR: a mock compacts on a scripted record, or on a token budget the run sets, estimated at four characters per token. The estimate is listed as a `modeled-surface` deviation in the cell.\n- Re-commit `adr/mock-compaction-trigger/ADR.md` with `Sloprail-Cites-User: <the user's exact answer>`, or tell me the exact words to use.\n- I then re-run sr-checks, push, open the PR, wait for CI and admin-merge once every check passes.\n\n**Cells (unchanged)**\n- **codex: supported, with two deviations.** Recorded in `codex-mock/snapshots/runs/compaction-transcript-continuity`. The mock adapter is `codex-mock/internal/session/compact.go`, and the test is `codex-mock/e2e/001_hooks/compaction_test.go`. The trigger is the token budget in `internal/compaction/budget.go`.\n- **cursor: unsupported.** Recorded in `cursor-mock/snapshots/runs/compaction-transcript-continuity`: headless `-p` has no compaction, `/summarize` is plain text, and no `preCompact` fires. I did not force a real context-overflow compaction.\n- **cursor capture binary.** The cursor run was captured with the 2026.09.28 binary, because cursor-agent auto-updated and `capture.sh` refuses a version mismatch."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":289,"cache_read_input_tokens":228888,"output_tokens":866,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":289},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":866,"cache_read_input_tokens":228888,"cache_creation_input_tokens":289,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":289,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cffhs1vsbwMXwpgxXTPPm","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"e4e9035f-75e5-4407-89f6-662a023361da","timestamp":"2026-10-03T17:33:57.754Z","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-aa43418fbebf671c6","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-a11c0a040e3cf682b"}
