{"parentUuid":"50bc4a7c-8351-419b-aa47-4fb116ceb081","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"0e75e1c2-9f84-43c4-8006-cccad7102c77","agentId":"aa43418fbebf671c6","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018N3nNUThrJNZZhS6hqHTQD","type":"tool_result","content":"14\t\n15\t## Decision\n16\t\n17\t- A harness whose compaction the scenario can script compacts only when the\n18\t  scenario says so: claude-mock compacts on the `compact` control record read\n19\t  in `claude-mock/internal/runner/control_compact.go`, with the token counts\n20\t  the record gives, and reads a count it is not given as 0, since a mock\n21\t  spends no tokens.\n22\t- A harness whose compaction is only the harness's own threshold (Codex's\n23\t  `model_auto_compact_token_limit`) compacts on a token budget: the limit is\n24\t  the run's setting, and what the context has grown by is estimated from the\n25\t  text the agent was told, at `compaction.CharsPerToken` characters to the\n26\t  token. The budget and the estimate live once, in `internal/compaction`; an\n27\t  adapter passes the limit and writes the compaction in its harness's form.\n28\t- A cell whose mock compacts on the estimate lists it as a `modeled-surface`\n29\t  deviation in its `providers.<harness>.deviations` field of\n30\t  `spec/capabilities/<id>.yaml`: the real harness counts the model's tokens.\n31\t"}]},"uuid":"558e3e84-352c-4968-a9c5-ea71f8e8fbf1","timestamp":"2026-10-03T17:42:57.805Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"50bc4a7c-8351-419b-aa47-4fb116ceb081","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-aa43418fbebf671c6","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-a5206b5b2ad4bea59"}
