{"parentUuid":"a19befee-29c7-493c-bf03-c37a395b9bbb","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"0e75e1c2-9f84-43c4-8006-cccad7102c77","agentId":"aa43418fbebf671c6","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KWvScUFYP4ZKp6Wiz8xTCM","type":"tool_result","content":"  codex:\n    docs:\n      - https://developers.openai.com/codex/config-reference#configtoml\n    runs:\n      - codex-mock/snapshots/runs/compaction-transcript-continuity\n    deviations:\n      - adr: capability-grounding\n        statement: >-\n          Codex leaves a compaction as one `compacted` record in the rollout,\n          not a boundary followed by a summary and a tail of earlier records:\n          the record holds the new window and the one it closes, and a\n          replacement history of the kept user messages (named by their\n          retained source) and then the summary, an opaque encrypted item. A\n          reader follows the chain across the compaction by the windows\n          (window_id, previous_window_id, window_number), not by the\n          parent links between records (recorded:\n          runs/compaction-transcript-continuity).\n      - adr: modeled-surface\n        statement: >-\n          The mock compacts when the tool output it has told the agent since\n          the last compaction, estimated at four characters to the token,\n          exceeds -c model_auto_compact_token_limit; Codex counts the model's\n          tokens, and also compacts on its own thresholds and by the\n          interactive /compact. The mock keeps only the prompt as the kept\n          message, and does not write the records Codex adds around a\n          compaction (turn_context, retained_context, resume_metadata) nor\n          fire its PreCompact and PostCompact hooks.\n  cursor:\n    supported: false\n    reason: a cursor-agent -p run that compacted twice (preCompact fired) left no boundary or summary record in its transcript, only the user prompt written again, and no record carries a link to another.\n    docs:\n      - https://cursor.com/docs/hooks#precompact\n    runs:\n      - cursor-mock/snapshots/runs/compaction-transcript-continuity","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"da2bfeba-784a-44cf-9638-c1d21532ef1e","timestamp":"2026-10-03T18:34:33.578Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"a19befee-29c7-493c-bf03-c37a395b9bbb","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-aa43418fbebf671c6","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-adc1470310079e23b"}
