{"parentUuid":"845cff51-070b-4432-b84d-97c5bb10ff4b","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"aa43418fbebf671c6","attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01TXZ5PuJCijLKVnbrBQxKHZ","copy":"wire"},{"id":"toolu_01UyxgCUZbVg5uEjdzSCqqf5","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"8349745b-dfee-46ae-b1fd-4e02ae2f50e2","timestamp":"2026-10-03T18:34:57.518Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-aa43418fbebf671c6","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-adc1470310079e23b"}
{"parentUuid":"8349745b-dfee-46ae-b1fd-4e02ae2f50e2","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"aa43418fbebf671c6","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CffnWoakNkpu4XyKSdjsF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I rebuilt the branch on origin/main instead of rebasing, because main already had a codex compaction. I've started the fifteenth sr-checks run, which is still going. Nothing is pushed yet, so there is no PR or merge.\n\nPR #123 had added a codex-mock scenario trigger (a `compact` record) and a stub `File.Compacted()`. That removed the reason for my token-budget trigger, so I dropped it. I kept the old work on local branch `ctc-old`.\n\n- **No ADR, no `module.yaml` change, no budget code.** The ADR, the `internal/compaction/budget.go` budget, the `-c` parsing and the `internal/compaction/module.yaml` edit are not in the new branch. The earlier ADR-grounding and module-glob refusals go away with them. Adding the ADR and module edit back would re-open the judge conflict.\n- **Mock change.** `Compacted()` in `codex-mock/internal/session/compact.go` now writes the real record shape (carrying `sr:provides compaction-transcript-continuity/codex`). It uses a new window id that names the one it closes, the kept user message, and an opaque summary item. It builds the kept tail with core `PlanBoundary`, and no marked declaration is edited.\n- **Test.** The new `codex-mock/e2e/001_hooks/compaction_continuity_test.go` checks the window chain in the real recording and in the mock replay (`compactingScript` from main).\n- **Test results.** `go vet ./codex-mock/...` and `go test ./codex-mock/e2e/...` pass.\n- **Codex cell.** It is supported and cites `hooks#precompact`, the run `compaction-transcript-continuity`, and two deviations: capability-grounding, and modeled-surface (scenario-triggered, not at a context limit).\n- **Cursor cell.** It is unchanged: unsupported, backed by the large recording where cursor compacted twice and left no boundary or summary record, plus the frozen `hooks#precompact` doc.\n- **Cursor capture binary.** The cursor run was captured with the 2026.09.28 binary, because cursor-agent auto-updated and `capture.sh` refuses a version mismatch.\n\nIf the run is clean, I push, open the PR, watch CI and admin-merge once every check passes. If it refuses, I'll report the refusal and stop."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1846,"cache_read_input_tokens":280712,"output_tokens":787,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1846},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":787,"cache_read_input_tokens":280712,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1846,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1846,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CffnWoJPTwTP5x9mEthym","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"6989e76c-dcff-462b-910d-d761f7311975","timestamp":"2026-10-03T18:34:57.518Z","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-aa43418fbebf671c6","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-adc1470310079e23b"}
