{"parentUuid":"015fd3f1-08de-4622-9b66-8b1aac7c171d","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"aa43418fbebf671c6","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cffo8W82BNvhH5BzNjDPj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Both cells are resolved and PR #129 is merged into main. sr-checks was clean and every CI check passed before the admin-merge.\n\n- **codex: supported, with two deviations.**\n  - Recorded run: `codex-mock/snapshots/runs/compaction-transcript-continuity`. Codex was run with `-c model_auto_compact_token_limit=4000` and compacted after each tool call. Each compaction left one `compacted` record chained by window ids, holding the kept prompt and an opaque encrypted summary.\n  - Mock: `File.Compacted()` in `codex-mock/internal/session/compact.go` writes the same record. It carries `sr:provides compaction-transcript-continuity/codex`.\n  - Test: `codex-mock/e2e/001_hooks/compaction_continuity_test.go` checks the chain in the recording and in the mock replay.\n  - Deviations: capability-grounding (one record chained by windows, not parent links) and modeled-surface (scenario-triggered, last user message only, placeholder summary, no `turn_context`-style records).\n- **cursor: unsupported.**\n  - Recorded run: `cursor-mock/snapshots/runs/compaction-transcript-continuity`. With about 728k input tokens, cursor compacted twice and `preCompact` fired, but the transcript has no boundary or summary record. It only writes the user prompt again, and no record links to another.\n  - Cell: cites the frozen `hooks#precompact` doc.\n  - Capture binary: it was captured with the 2026.09.28 binary, because cursor-agent auto-updated and `capture.sh` refuses a version mismatch.\n- **Dropped work.** I dropped my own token-budget trigger, the ADR and the `internal/compaction/module.yaml` edit. PR #123 had already added a scenario-triggered codex compaction, so none of them were needed and they had caused the judge conflicts. The old work is on local branch `ctc-old`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":209,"cache_read_input_tokens":286273,"output_tokens":655,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":209},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":655,"cache_read_input_tokens":286273,"cache_creation_input_tokens":209,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":209,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cffo8VogKjB2ASBWxeFBm","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"61dd7eba-9fc5-4470-837c-47092bf5b91a","timestamp":"2026-10-03T18:43:00.677Z","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-aa43418fbebf671c6","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-a8a444ee54a52b4dc"}
